    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The almighty Goddess of a magical labyrinth, has challenged adventurers to brave its perilous zones and reach its heart, where she awaits. Those who defeat her shall be granted a wish to fulfill their desires. As a Guild Master, you accept her challenge, recruiting and training your party on the path to her lair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild Encounters distills classic JRPG elements into a fast-paced, arcade-like experience. Players form a party of four adventurers from different classes and embark on a run through randomly selected zones, facing unpredictable encounters that culminate in a boss battle at the end of each zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon completing a run, players can spend their hard-earned Guild Points to unlock new adventurers, purchase game-altering items, and acquire ultimate weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battles\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic active turn-based battles where every fight brings new challenges! Dynamic Battle Conditions shake up combat\u2014boosting enemies, weakening your party, inflicting status effects, and more. Adapt your strategy, overcome the odds, and conquer powerful foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhancements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your strategy with powerful Enhancements! Earn Enhancement Points (EP) after each battle and equip temporary buffs to counter Battle Conditions and cover class weaknesses. Boost Max HP, strengthen attacks, and tailor your party to overcome any challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ranks and gear up at the Guild Shop! Recruit new heroes, acquire rare items, powerful weapons, and armor to strengthen your party for the battles ahead.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The almighty Goddess of a magical labyrinth, has challenged adventurers to brave its perilous zones and reach its heart, where she awaits. Those who defeat her shall be granted a wish to fulfill their desires. As a Guild Master, you accept her challenge, recruiting and training your party on the path to her lair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guild Encounters distills classic JRPG elements into a fast-paced, arcade-like experience. Players form a party of four adventurers from different classes and embark on a run through randomly selected zones, facing unpredictable encounters that culminate in a boss battle at the end of each zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon completing a run, players can spend their hard-earned Guild Points to unlock new adventurers, purchase game-altering items, and acquire ultimate weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battles\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic active turn-based battles where every fight brings new challenges! Dynamic Battle Conditions shake up combat\u2014boosting enemies, weakening your party, inflicting status effects, and more. Adapt your strategy, overcome the odds, and conquer powerful foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhancements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your strategy with powerful Enhancements! Earn Enhancement Points (EP) after each battle and equip temporary buffs to counter Battle Conditions and cover class weaknesses. Boost Max HP, strengthen attacks, and tailor your party to overcome any challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guild Shop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ranks and gear up at the Guild Shop! Recruit new heroes, acquire rare items, powerful weapons, and armor to strengthen your party for the battles ahead.</p>",
    "short_description": "Guild Encounters is a minimalist arcade JRPG. Recruit heroes, battle through dangerous zones, and conquer challenging turn-based encounters. Earn Guild Points to unlock new allies, powerful gear, and game-changing items. Face a gauntlet of battles as you journey to the final boss!",
